; `*` corrects the record: a later recall returns the correction, not what it
; replaced. Three calls — state it, correct it, then recall and repeat.
;
; The recall is free, so the count is what proves `*` fired nothing of its own.
; expect: calls 3
; expect: clean
; expect: answers
("Answer with exactly the sentence: The beacon is red."
 (* beacon "Answer with exactly the sentence: The beacon is green.")
 (-> (? beacon) "Repeat the sentence you were given, exactly."))
